 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "A Story of a Cannon Fodder who Firmly Believed He was the Protagonist, Misunderstood the Actual Protagonist as the Cannon Fodder, and Ended up Victorious"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja-ro": "Jibun no koto o shujinkouda to shinjite yamanai fumidai ga, shujinkou o fumidai da to kanchigai shite, yuushou shite shimau o-hanashi desu @COMIC"
   },
   {
    "ja": "自分の事を主人公だと信じてやまない踏み台が、主人公を踏み台だと勘違いして、優勝してしまうお話です@COMIC"
   },
   {
    "en": "Even Though I was the Cannon Fodder Character, The People Buzzing when I did Role Play as Protagonist."
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A certain high school boy who admired protagonists from manga and games died while saving a child. At that moment, God appeared and said he would reincarnate him as the protagonist in a visual novel game world. The boy trembled with joy, but that was God's big lie. His reincarnation destination was actually as a pathetically weak stepping-stone character! However, his extraordinary, abnormal efforts based on his delusion of being the protagonist began to drastically rewrite the status of this weak character! This changed the original course of the story, saved beautiful girls, and eventually even saved the world...? The heroic tale of a misunderstanding man who saves the world through sheer conviction!"
  },
